{"id":"b39bd6838766ad96","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-modular-exponentiation.md","title":"模运算与平方递归求幂","display":"df-modular-exponentiation — 模运算与平方递归求幂","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-modular-exponentiation","aliases":["73-df-modular-exponentiation"],"display":"df-modular-exponentiation — 模运算与平方递归求幂","depends_on":["[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.2–11.5.3, print pp. 514–517; PDF pp. 536–539","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-modular-exponentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-modular-exponentiation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-exponentiation — 模运算与平方递归求幂"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"498d8afd65d4a6ee\" href=\"?note=498d8afd65d4a6ee\" title=\"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages\">73-df-primes-and-composites-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.2–11.5.3, print pp. 514–517; PDF pp. 536–539"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。余数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>；偶数递归子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\ge1\">\\(e\\ge1\\)</span>，奇数子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\ge0\">\\(e\\ge0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x)\\coloneqq\\iota r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;n\\mid(x-r),\\qquad\nx+_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x+y),\\quad x\\cdot_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(xy).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x)\\coloneqq\\iota r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;n\\mid(x-r),\\qquad\nx+_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x+y),\\quad x\\cdot_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(xy).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a^e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a^e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>整数除法定理保证余数唯一。指数每次折半，故递归良基；对 e 归纳得到末式。每一步先取模，避免中间整数长度随指数数值指数增长。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-primes-and-composites-languages","status":"resolved","id":"498d8afd65d4a6ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-primes-and-composites-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"a,e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"e\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x)\\coloneqq\\iota r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\;n\\mid(x-r),\\qquad\nx+_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(x+y),\\quad x\\cdot_ny\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(xy).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,0)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,2e+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)^2)\\quad(e\\ge0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow}_n(a,e)=\\operatorname{Rem}_n(a^e).","display":true}],"bytes":1600,"backlinks":[{"id":"4307a2772edc1a3b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-modular-exponentiation|模运算与平方递归求幂]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"11ad5a1f324e7f83","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["498d8afd65d4a6ee"]}